+TurboGS was introduced in 2026 (preprint) as an acceleration framework for 3D Gaussian Splatting [S1, unofficial]. It builds upon the principles of error-guided sparse pixel sampling and optimization, addressing the trade-off between training speed and rendering quality in 3DGS [S1, unofficial].
 
